COPYRIGHT

hIPPyMFEM: deterministic and Bayesian inverse problems on MFEM, with the operators
obtained by differentiating a residual density at the quadrature points (JAX) and
the solves run through MFEM and hypre, on the host or on GPUs.

Copyright (c) 2026, Peng Chen, Georgia Institute of Technology.

